---
// Kafka High Throughput & Zero Message Loss Architecture Diagram Component
---

<figure class="kafka-diag" aria-labelledby="kafka-diag-caption">
  <svg
    class="kafka-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 460"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="kafka-diag-title kafka-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="kafka-diag-title">Apache Kafka 零丟失與超高吞吐底層架構</title>
    <desc id="kafka-diag-desc">
      展示 Kafka 如何透過 Producer 冪等重試與 acks=all、Broker 端 OS Page Cache
      與 Zero-Copy（零拷貝）DMA 傳輸，以及 ISR 多副本同步與手動 Offset
      提交，實現極致吞吐與零資料丟失。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="kf-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="kafka-diag__arrow-head"></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="kf-arrow-emerald"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="kafka-diag__arrow-head--emerald"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Block 1: Producer -->
    <g class="kafka-diag__card" transform="translate(30, 40)">
      <rect width="210" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="kafka-diag__badge" x="18" y="28">PRODUCER TIER</text>
      <text class="kafka-diag__title" x="18" y="58">生產者發送端</text>
      <text class="kafka-diag__desc" x="18" y="86"
        >• 批次壓縮 (Snappy / ZSTD)</text
      >
      <text class="kafka-diag__desc" x="18" y="108"
        >• RecordAccumulator 緩衝</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(14, 140)">
        <rect width="182" height="200" rx="8" class="kafka-diag__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="kafka-diag__subhead" x="12" y="24">零丟失核心設定</text>
        <text class="kafka-diag__code" x="12" y="48">acks = all (-1)</text>
        <text class="kafka-diag__code" x="12" y="68"
          >enable.idempotence = true</text
        >
        <text class="kafka-diag__subdesc" x="12" y="96"
          >• 內建 PID + Sequence ID</text
        >
        <text class="kafka-diag__subdesc" x="12" y="116"
          >• 重試不亂序、不重複寫入</text
        >
        <text class="kafka-diag__tag kafka-diag__tag--emerald" x="12" y="160"
          >精確一次 (EOS) 保證</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Arrow 1 to Broker -->
    <path
      class="kafka-diag__arrow kafka-diag__arrow--emerald"
      d="M 240 225 H 315"
      marker-end="url(#kf-arrow-emerald)"></path>
    <text class="kafka-diag__wire-label" x="278" y="215" text-anchor="middle"
      >批次寫入</text
    >

    <!-- Block 2: Broker & Zero-Copy Engine -->
    <g
      class="kafka-diag__card kafka-diag__card--emerald"
      transform="translate(320, 40)"
    >
      <rect width="310" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="kafka-diag__badge kafka-diag__badge--emerald" x="18" y="28"
        >CORE ENGINE</text
      >
      <text class="kafka-diag__title kafka-diag__title--emerald" x="18" y="58"
        >Kafka Broker 與 OS 核心</text
      >
      <text class="kafka-diag__desc" x="18" y="86"
        >• 順序寫入 (Sequential Disk I/O)</text
      >
      <text class="kafka-diag__desc" x="18" y="108"
        >• 規避 JVM GC（依賴 OS 快取）</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(14, 130)">
        <rect width="282" height="210" rx="8" class="kafka-diag__subcard--focus"
        ></rect>
        <text
          class="kafka-diag__subhead kafka-diag__subhead--emerald"
          x="14"
          y="26">Zero-Copy (零拷貝技術)</text
        >
        <text class="kafka-diag__code" x="14" y="52"
          >sendfile() 系統呼叫 + DMA</text
        >
        <text class="kafka-diag__subdesc" x="14" y="78"
          >• Page Cache ➔ Network Socket 直接傳輸</text
        >
        <text class="kafka-diag__subdesc" x="14" y="100"
          >• 繞過使用者空間（減少 2 次 Context Switch）</text
        >

        <path class="kafka-diag__divider" d="M 14 120 H 268"></path>

        <text class="kafka-diag__subhead" x="14" y="145">分區 Commit Log</text>
        <text class="kafka-diag__subdesc" x="14" y="168"
          >• 分割槽段 (Segment .log / .index)</text
        >
        <text class="kafka-diag__subdesc" x="14" y="190"
          >• 稀疏索引 (Sparse Index) 二分搜尋</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Arrow 2 to Storage & Consumer -->
    <path
      class="kafka-diag__arrow kafka-diag__arrow--emerald"
      d="M 630 225 H 710"
      marker-end="url(#kf-arrow-emerald)"></path>
    <text class="kafka-diag__wire-label" x="670" y="215" text-anchor="middle"
      >ISR 複寫 / 零拷貝消費</text
    >

    <!-- Block 3: ISR & Consumer -->
    <g class="kafka-diag__card" transform="translate(715, 40)">
      <rect width="215" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="kafka-diag__badge" x="18" y="28">REPLICATION & SINK</text>
      <text class="kafka-diag__title" x="18" y="58">ISR 副本與消費者</text>
      <text class="kafka-diag__desc" x="18" y="86"
        >• Leader + Follower 複寫</text
      >
      <text class="kafka-diag__desc" x="18" y="108"
        >• 高水位線 (High Watermark)</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(14, 140)">
        <rect width="187" height="200" rx="8" class="kafka-diag__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="kafka-diag__subhead" x="12" y="24">高可靠副本防禦</text>
        <text class="kafka-diag__code" x="12" y="48"
          >min.insync.replicas = 2</text
        >
        <text class="kafka-diag__code" x="12" y="68"
          >unclean.leader.election = false</text
        >
        <text class="kafka-diag__subdesc" x="12" y="96"
          >• 手動提交 Offset (No Auto-commit)</text
        >
        <text class="kafka-diag__subdesc" x="12" y="116"
          >• 死信佇列 (DLQ) 隔離毒藥丸</text
        >
        <text class="kafka-diag__tag kafka-diag__tag--emerald" x="12" y="160"
          >硬體故障零丟失</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile Version for 320px screens -->
  <div class="kafka-diag__mobile">
    <div class="kafka-mobile-card">
      <span class="kafka-mobile-badge">01. 生產者防線</span>
      <h4>冪等性與 acks=all</h4>
      <p>
        開啟 acks=all 與冪等性（Sequence
        ID），在發送端杜絕網路重試重複與訊息遺失。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="kafka-mobile-arrow">↓ 批次高效寫入</div>

    <div class="kafka-mobile-card kafka-mobile-card--emerald">
      <span class="kafka-mobile-badge kafka-mobile-badge--emerald"
        >02. 效能核心</span
      >
      <h4>順序 I/O 與 Zero-Copy (零拷貝)</h4>
      <p>
        充分利用 Linux Page Cache 順序寫入，消費時透過 sendfile() 與 DMA
        直接傳輸，釋放 CPU 運算力。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="kafka-mobile-arrow">↓ ISR 同步與消費</div>

    <div class="kafka-mobile-card">
      <span class="kafka-mobile-badge">03. 儲存與消費端</span>
      <h4>ISR 副本防護與手動提交 Offset</h4>
      <p>
        設定 min.insync.replicas=2 與禁止非同步 Leader 選舉，配合消費端手動提交
        Offset，達成全鏈路零丟失。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="kafka-diag-caption">
    圖 1：Apache Kafka 吞吐與可靠性架構：結合 acks=all 冪等發送、OS Page Cache
    與 Zero-Copy 零拷貝傳輸。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .kafka-diag {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-bg-card, #f8fafc);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e2e8f0);
    border-radius: 16px;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag {
    background: #091410;
    border-color: #1e293b;
  }

  .kafka-diag__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .kafka-diag__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  /* SVG Styles */
  .kafka-diag__card rect {
    fill: var(--color-bg-surface, #ffffff);
    stroke: var(--color-border, #cbd5e1);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__card rect {
    fill: #12201b;
    stroke: #1f362e;
  }

  .kafka-diag__card--emerald rect {
    fill: #f0fdf4;
    stroke: #059669;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__card--emerald rect {
    fill: #064e3b;
    stroke: #10b981;
  }

  .kafka-diag__subcard {
    fill: #f8fafc !important;
    stroke: #e2e8f0 !important;
    stroke-width: 1 !important;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__subcard {
    fill: #192b24 !important;
    stroke: #2b453b !important;
  }

  .kafka-diag__subcard--focus {
    fill: #ffffff !important;
    stroke: #059669 !important;
    stroke-width: 1.5 !important;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__subcard--focus {
    fill: #022c22 !important;
    stroke: #34d399 !important;
  }

  .kafka-diag__badge {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    fill: #64748b;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__badge {
    fill: #9ca3af;
  }

  .kafka-diag__badge--emerald {
    fill: #047857;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__badge--emerald {
    fill: #a7f3d0;
  }

  .kafka-diag__title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #0f172a;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__title {
    fill: #f9fafb;
  }

  .kafka-diag__title--emerald {
    fill: #065f46;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__title--emerald {
    fill: #d1fae5;
  }

  .kafka-diag__desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    fill: #475569;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__desc {
    fill: #9ca3af;
  }

  .kafka-diag__subhead {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #1e293b;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__subhead {
    fill: #e5e7eb;
  }

  .kafka-diag__subhead--emerald {
    fill: #065f46;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__subhead--emerald {
    fill: #6ee7b7;
  }

  .kafka-diag__subdesc {
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: #4b5563;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__subdesc {
    fill: #d1d5db;
  }

  .kafka-diag__code {
    font-family:
      ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: #047857;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__code {
    fill: #34d399;
  }

  .kafka-diag__tag {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #6b7280;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__tag {
    fill: #9ca3af;
  }

  .kafka-diag__tag--emerald {
    fill: #059669;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__tag--emerald {
    fill: #34d399;
  }

  .kafka-diag__divider {
    stroke: #d1fae5;
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__divider {
    stroke: #064e3b;
  }

  .kafka-diag__arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .kafka-diag__arrow--emerald {
    stroke: #059669;
    stroke-width: 2.5;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__arrow--emerald {
    stroke: #10b981;
  }

  .kafka-diag__arrow-head--emerald {
    fill: #059669;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__arrow-head--emerald {
    fill: #10b981;
  }

  .kafka-diag__wire-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: #047857;
  }

  :global(.dark) .kafka-diag__wire-label {
    fill: #6ee7b7;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, #64748b);
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Responsive for mobile */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .kafka-diag__desktop {
      display: none;
    }

    .kafka-diag__mobile {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .kafka-mobile-card {
      padding: 1rem;
      background: var(--color-bg-surface, #ffffff);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e2e8f0);
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    :global(.dark) .kafka-mobile-card {
      background: #12201b;
      border-color: #1f362e;
    }

    .kafka-mobile-card--emerald {
      background: #f0fdf4;
      border-color: #059669;
      border-left: 4px solid #047857;
    }

    :global(.dark) .kafka-mobile-card--emerald {
      background: #064e3b;
      border-color: #10b981;
    }

    .kafka-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #64748b;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .kafka-mobile-badge--emerald {
      color: #059669;
    }

    :global(.dark) .kafka-mobile-badge--emerald {
      color: #6ee7b7;
    }

    .kafka-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-text-main, #0f172a);
    }

    :global(.dark) .kafka-mobile-card h4 {
      color: #f9fafb;
    }

    .kafka-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--color-text-muted, #475569);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    :global(.dark) .kafka-mobile-card p {
      color: #9ca3af;
    }

    .kafka-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #6b7280;
      padding: 0.125rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
